597
00:42:45,804 --> 00:42:47,084
[kişisel bilgi]

598
00:42:47,444 --> 00:42:51,244
[kişisel bilgi]

599
00:42:52,364 --> 00:42:55,164
[kişisel bilgi]

600
00:42:55,184 --> 00:42:59,024
[kişisel bilgi]

601
00:42:59,604 --> 00:43:01,944
[kişisel bilgi]

602
00:43:02,604 --> 00:43:04,744
[kişisel bilgi]

603
00:43:05,584 --> 00:43:06,864
[kişisel bilgi]

